Jau!

01:19:44.202 --> 01:19:44.902
Pozor!

01:19:48.282 --> 01:19:48.812
[krik]

01:19:48.812 --> 01:19:49.802
Čo najviac sa priblížte.

01:19:51.402 --> 01:19:52.042
To je ono.

01:19:58.552 --> 01:20:08.042
[krik]

01:20:08.202 --> 01:20:11.042
Tu sme! Pán Gru!

01:20:11.391 --> 01:20:11.391
Pán Gru!

01:20:11.402 --> 01:20:14.762
Dievčatá, hej, hej, musíte odtiaľ skočiť.

01:20:15.242 --> 01:20:17.682
Skočiť? Vám asi preskočilo.

01:20:18.162 --> 01:20:19.282
Neboj sa, ja vás chytím.

01:20:20.422 --> 01:20:21.721
Vzdali ste sa nás.

01:20:21.922 --> 01:20:25.522
Ja viem, viem.
A bola to tá najhoršia chyba,

01:20:25.562 --> 01:20:28.462
urobil. Ale teraz musíte skočiť.

01:20:29.262 --> 01:20:30.142
To bude dobré.

01:20:36.342 --> 01:20:37.342
No tak skočte!

01:20:39.422 --> 01:20:40.142
Skočte!

